 data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/76/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/76\">#76</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class=\"commit-link\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/compare/v1.1.2...v1.1.3\"><tt>v1.1.2...v1.1.3</tt></a></p>",
