 {
  "repo": "sopa",
  "name": "v2.3.0",
  "tagName": "v2.3.0",
  "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T18:35:37Z",
  "url": "https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/releases/tag/v2.3.0",
  "descriptionHTML": "<p>This version includes several deprecations, detailed below. This aligns with the current scope of Sopa, i.e., mainly maintaining (1) the API and (2) the Nextflow pipeline.</p>\n<h2>Added</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable GPU usage for InstanSeg by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6186976654\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/461\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/461/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/461\">#461</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Deprecate the snakemake pipeline by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6095971186\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/458\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/458/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/458\">#458</a> - we now recommend using <a href=\"https://nf-co.re/sopa/\" rel=\"nofollow\">nf-core/sopa</a> instead. The snakemake workflow was archived <a href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/snakemake-sopa\">here</a>.</li>\n<li>Remove support for python 3.11 by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6183365814\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/460\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/460/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/460\">#460</a> in favor of python 3.14 now being added to the CI</li>\n<li>Deprecate tangram by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6183365814\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/460\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/460/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/460\">#460</a></li>\n<li>Never clip values by 0.99 quantile in raw readers by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6095234191\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/457\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/457/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/457\">#457</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class=\"commit-link\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/compare/v2.2.12...v2.3.0\"><tt>v2.2.12...v2.3.0</tt></a></p>",
  "isPrerelease": false
