  "descriptionHTML": "<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Support the Baysor Cpp implementation by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/alihamraoui/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/alihamraoui\">@alihamraoui</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4735252263\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/430\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/430/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/430\">#430</a></li>\n<li>Fix Stardist+Proseg usage on Visium HD for recent anndata versions by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5255139724\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/443\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/443/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/443\">#443</a></li>\n<li>Add CLI command to cache the cellpose model by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/alihamraoui/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/alihamraoui\">@alihamraoui</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5268511960\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/445\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/445/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/445\">#445</a></li>\n<li>Minor documentation fixes by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4890691829\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/issues/435\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/435/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/pull/435\">#435</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class=\"commit-link\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/sopa/compare/v2.2.10...v2.2.11\"><tt>v2.2.10...v2.2.11</tt></a></p>",
