  "publishedAt": "2026-07-08T11:40:30Z",
  "url": "https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/releases/tag/v1.1.1",
  "descriptionHTML": "<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Added a learning rate scheduler in fit and fine-tune. This should improve the model stability during training. It can be disabled using use_scheduler=False. By <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4836939659\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/66\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66\">#66</a></li>\n<li>Updated the default fit/fine_tune arguments: we now use patience=4 and min_delta=0.05 for slightly longer training by default. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4836939659\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/66\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66\">#66</a></li>\n<li>Misc docs updates (more advice, fix broken links, etc). <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4836939659\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/66\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66\">#66</a></li>\n<li>Remove old deprecated functions. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4836939659\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/66\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/66\">#66</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class=\"commit-link\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/compare/v1.1.0...v1.1.1\"><tt>v1.1.0...v1.1.1</tt></a></p>",
  "isPrerelease": false
 },
