  "descriptionHTML": "<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Added a new Novae model using scConcept embeddings as node features by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4750011012\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/63\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/63/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/63\">#63</a></li>\n<li>Conserve zero-shot prototypes when re-computing representations by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4684088368\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/60\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/60/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/60\">#60</a></li>\n<li>Use <code>np.float64</code> in kmeans to improve zero_shot reproducibility by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4700256878\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/61\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/61/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/61\">#61</a></li>\n<li>Fix ci: huggingface token and codecov by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/quentinblampey/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/quentinblampey\">@quentinblampey</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4595193491\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/issues/56\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/prism-oncology/novae/pull/56/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/pull/56\">#56</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class=\"commit-link\" href=\"https://github.com/prism-oncology/novae/compare/v1.0.7...v1.1.0\"><tt>v1.0.7...v1.1.0</tt></a></p>",
